<section class="tk-price"><div class="tk-shell">
<div class="tk-price-hero"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">TRACEKIT PLANS &amp; PRICING</span><h1>Simple pricing.<em>Powerful intelligence.</em></h1><p>Choose the plan that fits your business. Founding rates locked for 12 months.</p></div>
<div id="tk-price-plans" class="tk-price-grid"><article class="tk-price-card "><div class="tk-price-plan">Starter</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For advertisers operating one brand.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$199</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $299/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">1 brand</div><p class="tk-price-setup"><span class="tk-price-setup-regular">$500 setup</span> <strong class="tk-price-setup-saving">FREE during founding launch</strong></p><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo?plan=starter&amp;source=pricing">Book a Demo →</a><ul><li>Unlimited supported connections</li><li>Unlimited offers and team members</li><li>Customer journeys and attribution</li><li>Commerce and profitability reporting</li><li>Refunds and reconciliation</li></ul></article>
<article class="tk-price-card tk-price-popular"><span class="tk-price-recommend">POPULAR FOR MULTI-BRAND TEAMS</span><div class="tk-price-plan">Growth</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For advertisers growing across brands.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$399</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $599/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">Up to 3 brands</div><p class="tk-price-setup"><span class="tk-price-setup-regular">$500 setup</span> <strong class="tk-price-setup-saving">FREE during founding launch</strong></p><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo?plan=growth&amp;source=pricing">Book a Demo →</a><ul><li>Everything in Starter</li><li>Cross-brand reporting</li><li>Multi-brand Mission Control</li><li>Priority support</li></ul></article>
<article class="tk-price-card "><div class="tk-price-plan">Scale</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For established performance-marketing teams.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$699</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $999/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">Up to 10 brands</div><p class="tk-price-setup"><span class="tk-price-setup-regular">$500 setup</span> <strong class="tk-price-setup-saving">FREE during founding launch</strong></p><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo?plan=scale&amp;source=pricing">Book a Demo →</a><ul><li>Everything in Growth</li><li>Larger organizational scale</li><li>Priority onboarding and support</li></ul></article>
<article class="tk-price-card "><div class="tk-price-plan">Agency</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For agencies managing independent advertiser clients.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$999</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $1299/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">Up to 5 client advertisers</div><p class="tk-price-setup"><span class="tk-price-setup-regular">$1,000 setup</span> <strong class="tk-price-setup-saving">$500 during founding launch</strong></p><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo?plan=agency&amp;source=pricing">Book a Demo →</a><ul><li>Separate client environments</li><li>Client-level access and permissions</li><li>Agency portfolio visibility</li><li>Client context switching</li><li>Core reporting and reconciliation</li></ul></article></div>
<div class="tk-price-founding"><div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">FOUNDING LAUNCH OFFER</span><h2>Founding launch benefits</h2><p>Enroll during the 14-day launch window and keep your founding rate for 12 months. <strong>Free $500 setup</strong> on Starter, Growth &amp; Scale; <strong>50% off Agency setup.</strong></p></div><div class="tk-price-founding-facts"><span>Founding rates locked for 12 months</span><span>No per-user, per-offer, or per-connector charges</span><a href="/pages/book-a-demo?intent=demo&amp;source=pricing">Checkout coming soon — Book a Demo →</a></div></div>
<div class="tk-price-note">USD/month. Founding rates apply to enrollments during the 14 days after paid launch and last 12 months; regular rates apply afterward. Standard setup is waived for Starter, Growth &amp; Scale and discounted to $500 for Agency. Checkout is not yet active. Feature availability, fair use, and other terms are detailed below.</div>
<div class="tk-price-enterprise"><div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">CUSTOM SOLUTIONS</span><h2>Enterprise</h2><p>For larger advertisers, agencies, networks, and organizations with complex data, access, or infrastructure requirements. Let's scope your brand/client capacity, integrations, onboarding, and commercial needs together.</p><small>Enterprise implementation fees are quoted after a scoping call. Capabilities and service commitments are confirmed individually; no unverified SSO, infrastructure, or SLA promises.</small></div><a class="btn" href="/pages/book-a-demo?plan=enterprise&amp;source=pricing">Contact Sales →</a></div>
<div class="tk-price-section-title"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">THE CORE DOESN'T CHANGE</span><h2>Every plan starts with connected evidence.</h2></div>
<div class="tk-price-benefits"><div><strong>Unlimited supported connections</strong><p>Connect available sources without buying connector add-ons.</p></div><div><strong>Unlimited offers and users</strong><p>Organize offers and teams without per-seat or per-offer fees.</p></div><div><strong>Commerce and profitability</strong><p>Track journeys, orders, refunds, chargebacks, and financial outcomes.</p></div><div><strong>Reconciliation and visibility</strong><p>Investigate linked records, discrepancies, and unresolved evidence.</p></div></div>
<p class="tk-price-availability">Mission Control, alerts, Intelligence, MCP, and other capabilities are offered according to their verified production availability and account permissions. Plan descriptions do not imply unreleased features are active today.</p>
<div class="tk-price-section-title"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">GOOD TO KNOW</span><h2>Pricing questions, answered.</h2></div>
<div class="tk-price-faq">
<details><summary>What counts as a brand?</summary><p>A brand is a distinct commercial business identity operating its own products or offers. Multiple domains, campaigns, and offers for that business do not automatically count as separate brands. The final definition is subject to entitlement validation.</p></details>
<details><summary>Are connections, offers, or team members limited?</summary><p>There are no per-connector, per-offer, or per-user charges. Connections must be supported and available for your environment, and reasonable fair-use protections apply.</p></details>
<details><summary>How does founding pricing work?</summary><p>Starter, Growth, and Scale founding rates are open to all eligible customers who enroll within 14 calendar days after our official paid-subscription launch. Your founding monthly rate lasts for 12 months, then transitions to the regular rate under the subscription agreement. The $500 standard white-glove setup fee is waived for those plans during the launch window. No 20-customer cap applies.</p></details>
<details><summary>What does white-glove onboarding include?</summary><p>Personalized account setup, hands-on assistance connecting supported platforms, initial synchronization guidance, and assessment of missing connectors. New connector development is subject to technical feasibility and a separately agreed scope; unlimited custom engineering is not included.</p></details>
<details><summary>How is Agency different?</summary><p>Agency supports multiple independent advertiser clients, with separate client data and permissions. Pricing for additional clients and brand allowances per client will be confirmed before contracting.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I subscribe immediately?</summary><p>Not yet. Self-service monthly checkout for Starter, Growth, and Scale is being prepared. Until payments and account activation are ready, you can book a demo. Agency and Enterprise remain sales-assisted.</p></details>
</div>
<div class="tk-price-final"><div><h2>Know where every dollar goes.</h2><p>Let's find the right TraceKit plan for your business.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/pages/book-a-demo?intent=founding&amp;source=pricing">Book a Demo →</a></div>
</div></section>
